# ── URL Normalization (Netlify + Cloudflare Pages compatible) ──
# .htm → canonical clean URL (Netlify only — Cloudflare Pages skips this rule)
/*.htm  https://plumbers-dubai.com/:splat  301

# /index.html at root → /
/index.html  /  301

# /page/index.html → /page/
/*/index.html  /:splat/  301

# NOTE: no "/* /404.html 404" catch-all here — Cloudflare Pages does not
# support 404-status rules (it serves /404.html natively for missing paths,
# and Netlify does the same). Adding it would just log CF parse errors.

